# Note this file only supports static key value pairs so it can be loaded by make, bash, python, and sbt without any additional parsing.
# Every image and the KFP pipeline is listed once per Python minor in SUPPORTED_PYTHON_VERSIONS (bottom of this file).
# Each of those keys ends in the minor's image tag suffix, e.g. DOCKER_LATEST_BUILDER_IMAGE_NAME_WITH_TAG_py313 for 3.13.
# .github/scripts/update_docker_image_refs.sh writes the base and builder refs; scripts/bump_version.py writes the
# release refs.
